title: PyLadies Hamburg - Community Partner
---
full_description: We're the Hamburg chapter of PyLadies, an international mentorship group for
marginalized genders, such as but not limited to non-binary people, trans
people, and women in tech. 

We host monthly events, talks, workshops
and study groups where you can meet other pythonistas and learn more about
programming, data science, web development, and more. All skill levels
welcome!
